SUMMARY:TrollInstallerX v1.0.3
DESCRIPTION:TrollInstallerX 1.0.3 | TrollInstallerX\n\n# TrollInstallerX v1
 .0.3\n\n## Changes:\n* Update for Xcode 15.4+ compilation (fixes #25)\n* A
 dded a temporary fix for yellow iPhone 14 (Plus) devices on iOS 16.3\, ple
 ase use `TrollInstallerX-20D50.ipa` (fixes #33)\n* Removing confusing logg
 ing around exploit deinitialisation (e.g. #11)\n* Fix arm64e devices on iO
 S 15.7.x that couldn't download the kernelcache by updating libgrabkernel2
  (should\, in theory\, fix #21)\n\n**Note**: A8 devices on iOS 15.2+ will 
 not be supported until a future release of TrollInstallerX. Furthermore\, 
 support for arm64e (A12+) devices on early iOS 17.0 betas is not planned\,
  unless someone else would like to implement it. You can now use [TrollRes
 tore](https://github.com/JJTech0130/TrollRestore) for both of these cases.
 \n\n# DO NOT DOWNLOAD THE 20D50 IPA UNLESS YOU HAVE A YELLOW IPHONE 14 (PL
 US) ON IOS 16.3.
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/trollinstallerx.json
END:VEVENT
